  - Written out in full from the Palladium Fantasy `assassin` (palladium-fantasy-core p.94-96), NOT a copy_of it: that row is a Palladium Fantasy class and this one is Rifts, so every pair would differ on system and a cross-system copy would be the only one in the catalog. Its ladder, attribute requirements, bonuses, O.C.C. skills, related-skill floors, secondary skills and money are the Assassin''s as that row stores them; the ladder is copied in per the 2026-09-26 borrowed-ladder decision.
