# Gosai Assassin

## Lore

The Gosai Assassin is a professional killer who refuses to employ weapons of any sort. Brought to the Palladium World as assassins and spies during the Elf-Dwarf War, the Gosai kept the trade, and a Gosai Assassin trains in Skudasa - a unique unarmed style, a cross between Martial Arts and Assassin combat training, that makes weapons of the race''s own clawed hands and feet and its pop-hinged kicks.

Level-headed and methodical, a Gosai Assassin can seem absolutely cold and hard as ice. He cares little for wealth; reputation, glory and infamy are what he works for.

## GM Notes

The Gosai Assassin is otherwise the Palladium Assassin O.C.C. Only the Gosai Assassin may take Hand to Hand: Skudasa.
